命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a-wt-t078/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-zxitspms/c-yzxxxn6j/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261016-1' '--attempt' '4a873fa3-32c3-4a50-a648-22b7daee0e4d' '--session' '9ce0342c-d186-4072-9477-a6a726386201' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-16T08:22:04.131Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"4a873fa3-32c3-4a50-a648-22b7daee0e4d","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt_id":"4a873fa3-32c3-4a50-a648-22b7daee0e4d","session_id":"9ce0342c-d186-4072-9477-a6a726386201","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"bcfb0005-f503-4c6a-a6c6-aaa1643aab2e","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"00fea673-f34a-44fe-b383-3b45c27c77e8","thread":"bcfb0005-f503-4c6a-a6c6-aaa1643aab2e","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-00fea673-f34a-44fe-b383-3b45c27c77e8"},"workspace":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-zxitspms/c-yzxxxn6j/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261016-1-a1","base_commit":"f5e63e05208e6bd1ad1c9f58ed01c63584ec9ab8","card_snapshot_id":"23100f7a-2569-447e-bd59-e6899cfb87d0","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261016-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-16T08:22:05.389Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"4a873fa3-32c3-4a50-a648-22b7daee0e4d","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/Volumes/WD-Elements/a2a-workbench/q76-z